<title>USA: Pennzoil, Conoco in joint products venture.</title>
<headline>Pennzoil, Conoco in joint products venture.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pennzoil Products Co and Conoco Inc, a unit of DuPont Co, have agreed to form a joint venture that will combine portions of their specialty petroleum products businesses.</p>
<p>The 50/50 joint venture, to be called Penreco, will have estimated annual sales of about $200 million worldwide, the companies said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
